oning category covers reasoning, reflection, retrieval (p1). Acting covers action models, robots, tools, assistants. Interacting covers multi-agent systems, role-playing, open-ended societies. Literature selection section 1.2 on page 5 - still need details on search methods. Contribution: survey field, show categories complement each other, research agenda Table 4 (p3). Virtuous cycle feedback loops generate training data (p3).', evidence_ids=['ev-03c9580cc4ea3469a3d3','ev-c3c928f38ebc0ac0c6cd','ev-84af1a450301aa5252ba'], section='overview'))"}, "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1793247288, "model": "deepseek-flash", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "usage": {"_type": "CompletionUsage", "completion_tokens": 272, "prompt_tokens": 7697, "total_tokens": 7969, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"_type": "PromptTokensDetails", "audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4224}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 7697, "output_tokens": 272, "total_tokens": 7969}}, "model_output": "{\"thought\":\"I have received pages 1, 2, 3, and 12 so far. Let me write an initial overview note capturing categories and search methods (need to find literature selection details on page 5), then continue reading. First, let me note what I have and request remaining pending pages by writing a note to advance the batch.\",\"code\": \"print(write_note(title='Overview initial', content='Paper defines agentic LLMs as LLMs that (1) reason, (2) act, (3) interact. Three categories: reasoning, acting, interacting (p1, p3). Reasoning category covers reasoning, reflection, retrieval (p1). Acting covers action models, robots, tools, assistants. Interacting covers multi-agent systems, role-playing, open-ended societies. Literature selection section 1.2 on page 5 - still need details on search methods. Contribution: survey field, show categories complement each other, research agenda Table 4 (p3). Virtuous cycle feedback loops generate training data (p3).', evidence_ids=['ev-03c9580cc4ea3469a3d3','ev-c3c928f38ebc0ac0c6cd','ev-84af1a450301aa5252ba'], section='overview'))\" }", "code_action": "print(write_note(title='Overview initial', content='Paper defines agentic LLMs as LLMs that (1) reason, (2) act, (3) interact. Three categories: reasoning, acting, interacting (p1, p3). Reasoning category covers reasoning, reflection, retrieval (p1). Acting covers action models, robots, tools, assistants. Interacting covers multi-agent systems, role-playing, open-ended societies. Literature selection section 1.2 on page 5 - still need details on search methods. Contribution: survey field, show categories complement each other, research agenda Table 4 (p3). Virtuous cycle feedback loops generate training data (p3).', evidence_ids=['ev-03c9580cc4ea3469a3d3','ev-c3c928f38ebc0ac0c6cd','ev-84af1a450301aa5252ba'], section='overview'))", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'overview', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 569}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 7697, "output_tokens": 272, "total_tokens": 7969}, "is_final_answer": false}}
