trieval Augmentation 2.3), Acting (3.1 World Models/VLA, 3.2 Robot/Tools, 3.3 Assistants), Interacting (4.1 Social Capabilities, 4.2 Role-based, 4.3 Open-ended Societies). Page 13: Self-Consistency vs CoT; greedy vs tree search; Tree of Thoughts external control algorithm with generation+eval prompts and search; ToT describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller (p13). Page 8 lays out category aims. Still need exact Self Consistency selection rule (majority vote) from p10-12. Page 22 Inner Monologue and Say Can robot feedback.','evidence_ids':['ev-f5fa865a87a2cd077881','ev-4049593a30e2846f8394','ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b'], section='reasoning')\nr = read_pdf(10, 12)\nprint([p['page'] for p in r['pages']])", "observations": "Execution logs:\n[15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 20, 21]\n", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8088, "output_tokens": 359, "total_tokens": 8447}, "is_final_answer": false}}
