). Tree of Thoughts [Yao et al. 2024]: page 13 states ToT introduces breadth-first and depth-first search controllers (two controllers). Page 13 quote on ToT search needed; page 9 Table 1 lists ToT depth-first-search prompts. Reasoning framing: CoT step-by-step (page 9), interpreter/debugger & planning & retrieval & evolutionary (pages 12-13).', evidence_ids=['ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3','ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97'], section='reasoning')"}, "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1793247304, "model": "deepseek-flash", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "usage": {"_type": "CompletionUsage", "completion_tokens": 277, "prompt_tokens": 8006, "total_tokens": 8283, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"_type": "PromptTokensDetails", "audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4224}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8006, "output_tokens": 277, "total_tokens": 8283}}, "model_output": "{\"thought\":\"Pages 9-10 delivered: Self-Consistency uses majority voting of sampled reasoning paths; Table 2 shows Toolformer tools (Calculator, Search engine) and ToolBench 16,464 APIs. Need ToT search controllers (breadth-first and depth-first from earlier page 13) and exact quotes. Update reasoning note with page 10 quote for self-consistency; keep totals.\",\"code\":\"write_note(title='reasoning note final', content='Page 10: Self Consistency [Wang et al. 2022] is an ensemble that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting (page 10 exact: \\\"selects the most consistent answer using majority voting\\\"). Tree of Thoughts [Yao et al. 2024]: page 13 states ToT introduces breadth-first and depth-first search controllers (two controllers). Page 13 quote on ToT search needed; page 9