y needed between LLM invocations (Tree of Thoughts branch memory, Self Refine state).', evidence_ids=['ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa','ev-b8db09947ef7c899cd9d'], section='overview')"}, "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1793247309, "model": "deepseek-flash", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "usage": {"_type": "CompletionUsage", "completion_tokens": 287, "prompt_tokens": 6914, "total_tokens": 7201, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"_type": "PromptTokensDetails", "audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4224}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 6914, "output_tokens": 287, "total_tokens": 7201}}, "model_output": "{\"thought\":\"Pages 14-15 cover prompt-improvement and self-reflection (PHP, Self Refine, Reflexion, Self Discover). Not directly answering my questions, but I should note remaining pages. The pending requirement says write_note for pages 11,14,15; overview already updated with p11. Update overview note to include p14-15 facts and correct prior truncation.\",\"code\":\"write_note(title='overview', content='Categories (three): reasoning, acting, interacting - agentic capabilities of LLMs. Search methods: start with keyword searches on arXiv, then expand via snowballing/citation chasing and retrieval & evolutionary (pages 12-13). Page 11 Table 3 interaction taxonomy: multi-agent frameworks - CAMEL roleplaying, AutoGen, AgentVerse, ChatEval, OASIS, WebArena, social dilemma. Pages 14-15 move passive model to active agent: prompt-improvement (PHP) and self reflection (Self Refine: p_gen/p_fb/p_refine; Reflexion actor/evaluator/reflector; Self Discover). External memory needed between LLM invocations (Tree of Thoughts branch memory, Self Refine state).', evidence_ids=['ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa','ev-b8db09947ef7