 "cached_tokens": 4352}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8309, "output_tokens": 373, "total_tokens": 8682}}, "model_output": "{\"thought\":\"Batch 16,17,18,34,36 read. Update reasoning note with these pages (CoT, self-reflection, retrieval, implicit reasoning) preserving the two answers, then continue.\",\"code\":\"write_note(title='reasoning', content='Page 10: Self Consistency [Wang et al. 2022] samples diverse reasoning paths and \\\"selects the most consistent answer using majority voting\\\" (page 10). Tree of Thoughts [Yao et al. 2024]: page 13 introduces breadth-first and depth-first search controllers (two controllers). Pages 16-17: implicit reasoning via RL (DeepSeek-R1, GRPO, RLVR) vs explicit inference-time methods; memory gives experience/personality. Pages 17-18: retrieval augmentation (RAG, adaptive retrieval) adds timely info; DeepSeek-R1 with self-generated reasoning. Page 18: CoT step-by-step prompting; self reflection challenges: oscillating models and long traces overflow context, compress traces; System 1 vs System 2. Pages 34,36 (social/theory of mind): LLM chatbots vs 276 humans on social judgment; AucArena auctions on LLaMa2/Mistral/Mixtral/Gemini/GPT; Alympics water allocation strategy game. Keeps the two reasoning answers: majority voting; [breadth_first_search, depth_first_search].', evidence_ids=['ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248','ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c','ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4','ev-41048209f3096e51f36b','ev-345e6706309ac04ee927'], section='reasoning')\"}", "code_action": "write_note(title='reasoning', content='Page 10: Self Consistency [Wang et al. 2022] samples diverse reasoning paths and \"selects the most consistent answer using majority voting\" (page 10). Tree of Thoughts [Yao et al. 2024]: page 13 introduces breadth-first and depth-first search controllers (two controllers). Pages 16-17: implicit reasoning via RL (DeepSeek-R1, GRPO, RLVR) vs explicit inference-time methods; memory gives experience/personality. Pages 17-18: retrieval augmentation (RAG, adaptive retrieval) adds timely info; DeepSeek-R1 with self-generated reasoning. Page 18: CoT step-by-step prompting; self reflection challenges: oscillating models and long traces overflow context, compress traces; System 1 vs System 2. Pages 34,36 (social/theory of mind): LLM chatbots vs 276 humans on social judgment; AucArena auctions on LLaMa2/Mistral/Mixtral/Gemini/GPT; Alympics water allocation strategy game. Keeps the two reasoning answers: majority voting; [breadth_first_search, depth_first_search].', evidence_ids=['ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248','ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c','ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4','ev-41048209f3096e51f36b','ev-345e6706309ac04ee927'], section='reasoning')", "observations": "Execution logs:\nLast output from code snippet:\n{'note_id': 'reasoning', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 966}", "observations_images": null, "action_output": {"note_id": "reasoning", "sources": ["paper.pdf"], "chars": 966}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8309, "output_tokens": 373, "total_tokens": 8682}, "is_final_answer": false}}
