_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4224}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8394, "output_tokens": 344, "total_tokens": 8738}}, "model_output": "{\"thought\":\"Received batch: pages 32,33,40. Noting social capabilities pages briefly, then summarizing to release more pages.\",\"code\":\"write_note(title='multi_agent', content='Page 37: CAMEL uses \\\"inception prompting and role descriptions\\\" so agents stay in character and collaborate (camel_prompting=inception_prompting). Page 35 (Table/Generative Agents): 100 human evaluators rated believability (generative_agents_evaluators=100). Pages 32-33: social capabilities of LLMs - conversation, etiquette/empathy, strategic behavior (iterated Prisoners Dilemma, GTBench games), theory of mind benchmarks; LLMs lag humans in social intelligence. Page 40: AgentSociety simulates >10,000 agents for polarization, misinformation, UBI policy and hurricane shocks; AgentVerse group dynamics with four stages (expert recruitment, collaborative decision making, action execution, evaluation), emergent volunteering. Page 37: role-based task solving, creator-critic (Constitutional AI), debate (society of minds), MAD with judge. Answers: camel_prompting=inception_prompting; generative_agents_evaluators=100.', evidence_ids=['ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da','ev-97c7764bd93b97111551','ev-2c646589154451e7b722','ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055','ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186','ev-2bcb169328f17ac85c9d'], section='multi_agent')\"}", "code_action": "write_note(title='multi_agent', content='Page 37: CAMEL uses \"inception prompting and role descriptions\" so agents stay in character and collaborate (camel_prompting=inception_prompting). Page 35 (Table/Generative Agents): 100 human evaluators rated believability (generative_agents_evaluators=100). Pages 32-33: social capabilities of LLMs - conversation, etiquette/empathy, strategic behavior (iterated Prisoners Dilemma, GTBench games), theory of mind benchmarks; LLMs lag humans in social intelligence. Page 40: AgentSociety simulates >10,000 agents for polarization, misinformation, UBI policy and hurricane shocks; AgentVerse group dynamics with four stages (expert recruitment, collaborative decision making, action execution, evaluation), emergent volunteering. Page 37: role-based task solving, creator-critic (Constitutional AI), debate (society of minds), MAD with judge. Answers: camel_prompting=inception_prompting; generative_agents_evaluators=100.', evidence_ids=['ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da','ev-97c7764bd93b97111551','ev-2c646589154451e7b722','ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055','ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186','ev-2bcb169328f17ac85c9d'], section='multi_agent')", "observations": "Execution logs:\nLast output from code snippet:\n{'note_id': 'multi_agent', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 921}", "observations_images": null, "action_output": {"note_id": "multi_agent", "sources": ["paper.pdf"], "chars": 921}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8394, "output_tokens": 344, "total_tokens": 8738}, "is_final_answer": false}}
